  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "好痛好痛……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n哎呀，你是来帮我找东西的吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D75DB597D75DB2026202600100001BE01000A54CE5440FF0C4F60662F67655E2E6211627E4E1C897F76845417FF1F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我呀……把戒指弄丢在\n这个安息墓地里了。好痛……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211544020262026628A621263075F044E225728000A8FD94E2A5B89606F5893573091CC4E863002597D75DB2026202600100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我在扫墓时被突然出现的\n野生宝可梦吓了一跳，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n然后就摔倒了……真是的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115728626B589365F688AB7A81713651FA73B07684000A91CE751F5B9D53EF68A654134E864E008DF3FF0C00100001BE00000A7136540E5C31645450124E8620262026771F662F7684FF0100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "城市里的野生宝可梦变多，\n墓地变成野生特区，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以才会发生弄丢戒指这种事！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57CE5E0291CC768491CE751F5B9D53EF68A653D8591AFF0C000A5893573053D8621091CE751F7279533AFF0C00100001BE00000A62404EE5624D4F1A53D1751F5F044E22621263078FD979CD4E8BFF0100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那时突然出现的肯定\n是一种叫勾魂眼的宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n似乎只有妖精属性能克制它，\n遇上它时请你多加注意。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A365F67A81713651FA73B0768480AF5B9A000A662F4E0079CD53EB52FE9B42773C76845B9D53EF68A6300200100001BE01000A4F3C4E4E53EA670959967CBE5C5E602780FD514B52365B83FF0C000A90474E0A5B8365F68BF74F60591A52A06CE8610F300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我应该是在安息墓地的\n深处把戒指弄丢的。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你去找的时候要小心哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115E948BE5662F57285B89606F589357307684000A6DF15904628A621263075F044E227684300200100001BE00000A4F6053BB627E768465F6501989815C0F5FC354E6300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那只勾魂眼……\n似乎拿着委托人的戒指。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A353EA52FE9B42773C20262026000A4F3C4E4E62FF774059D462584EBA76846212630730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要与它对战，\n取回戒指吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6089814E0E5B835BF96218FF0C000A53D656DE621263075417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "与它对战！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0E5B835BF96218FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "眼咪～！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "773C54AAFF5EFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "勾魂眼放下\n纪念戒指离去了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52FE9B42773C653E4E0B000A7EAA5FF56212630779BB53BB4E86300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原来纪念戒指是在勾魂眼的手上。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F67657EAA5FF562126307662F572852FE9B42773C7684624B4E0A300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把戒指交给委托人吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A621263074EA47ED959D462584EBA5427FF0100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的委托进行得怎么样？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n戒指没被野生宝可梦吃掉，\n或是被做了什么不好的事吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211768459D462588FDB884C5F97600E4E486837FF1F00100001BE01000A621263076CA188AB91CE751F5B9D53EF68A654036389FF0C000A6216662F88AB505A4E864EC04E484E0D597D76844E8B5427FF1F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀！那是我的戒指！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF0190A3662F6211768462126307FF0100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把纪念戒指交给对方了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A7EAA5FF5621263074EA47ED95BF965B94E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦，是这样吗？\n勾魂眼它……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E6FF0C662F8FD968375417FF1F000A52FE9B42773C5B832026202600100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "明明是野生宝可梦却看上了\n我的戒指，它的眼光不错嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "660E660E662F91CE751F5B9D53EF68A65374770B4E0A4E86000A6211768462126307FF0C5B837684773C51494E0D9519561B300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但这是我丈夫给我的结婚戒指，\n现在还不能送给它。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F468FD9662F62114E08592B7ED9621176847ED35A5A62126307FF0C000A73B057288FD84E0D80FD90017ED95B83300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "感谢你，\n这是我的一点心意。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "611F8C224F60FF0C000A8FD9662F621176844E0070B95FC3610F300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会拜托别人在我离世后\n把戒指放到坟墓上的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A62DC6258522B4EBA5728621179BB4E16540E000A628A62126307653E5230575F58934E0A7684300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那样说不定勾魂眼\n就会再次把戒指拿走。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A368378BF44E0D5B9A52FE9B42773C000A5C314F1A518D6B21628A6212630762FF8D70300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但那样能让它开心的话也不错。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n即使它是野生宝可梦，\n只要有眼光也必须认可它才是呀！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4690A3683780FD8BA95B835F005FC376848BDD4E5F4E0D9519300200100001BE01000A53734F7F5B83662F91CE751F5B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A53EA89816709773C51494E5F5FC5987B8BA453EF5B83624D662F5440FF0100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果勾魂眼能够珍惜我的回忆，\n那就太棒了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C52FE9B42773C80FD591F73CD60DC6211768456DE5FC6FF0C000A90A35C31592A68D24E86300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    }
